+# Executive referee — free-free-second-state-tightness-alln (2026-11-22)
+
+- Office: executive (independent executive delivery, NOT a parliamentary sitting).
+- Host: billy-dev. Timestamp: 2026-11-22 ~16:4xZ.
+- Result refereed: `free-free-second-state-tightness-alln`, #301 comment
+  `sha256:6fxijNuaXFsZbD8xnercXldv0JiKlG6Rrge0gFYddNs`, posted
+  2026-11-22T16:32:19Z.
